! _POC-XRVPWS SW1(IOL-L2 17.15・据付)= お客さま E の拠点 4。XE1 と XE2 に LACP の束で二重に収容(XRT-12 と同じ形)。
! VLAN 150= EVPN-VPWS・160= LDP の疑似回線。どちらも SVI で拠点 3(CE3)と話す。★IOL-L2 は VTP サーバのままだと day0 の vlan が効かない→ transparent。
vtp mode transparent
vlan 150
 name ELINE-EVPN
vlan 160
 name ELINE-LDP
!
interface Port-channel1
 description to XE1 + XE2 (one bundle)
 switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
 switchport mode trunk
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 150,160
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to XE1
 switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
 switchport mode trunk
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 150,160
 channel-group 1 mode active
 lacp rate fast
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to XE2
 switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
 switchport mode trunk
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 150,160
 channel-group 1 mode active
 lacp rate fast
 no shutdown
!
interface Vlan150
 description E-Line (EVPN-VPWS) to site 3
 ip address 172.31.150.4 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface Vlan160
 description E-Line (LDP pseudowire) to site 3
 ip address 172.31.160.4 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
